/* No genre filter this release: the column is just the ways to bring sounds in. */
#splash.start #sp-random.sp-list2 .sl-genres.nogenre #sp-genres.sl-glist { display: none !important; }
/* From scratch is only a blank session (tester, 2026-11-18): no Chop, no Bars, just Start blank. */
