   to show … those packs, and then everything else can be scrolled below"): 14 + 24 header + 12 + 5 × 96 + 4 × 12 + 14.
   (A smaller screen keeps what fits.) */
#splash.start #sp-random.sp-list2 { max-height: 592px; align-self: start; }
