/* ==== One system for sections (tester, 2026-10-27 audit) ========================================================
   Every collapsible section — a lane at rest, an open editor — has the same header row: [⏻ power] [◯› chevron]
   [icon] [Name] … [✕ close, when open]. The whole row is the control: hover lightens the whole row (no outlines on
   the chevron or icon), a click anywhere on it opens or closes; the power key and ✕ do only their own thing.
