body.skin-lcd.mk-2 #dock .pv .mods-grid .mg-btn:is(.on, :active:not(.dis)) .mg-ic { color: #fff !important; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px var(--tc, #22e6ff)) !important; }
/* ---- The track keys (Solo, Preview, Loop, Sample, Clear, Mono) in the tester's wide photo set (2026-11-03): the frosted
   keys made wide, cut by prototypes/modkeys/make.mjs into img/btn/w2-*. Drawn 9-slice, so the corners keep their shape
   at the keys' width. Lit and pressed are grey with their light tinted in the track's colour (the light masked the same
   9-slice way), as the Mods keys. Hover only when off. The name: the size it had, a weight between it and the Mods
   keys' (tester: "the size of the ones on the top … a weight in between the two"). Flat and neon keep their own. ---- */
body.skin-lcd:not(.keys-flat, .keys-neon) .pv :is(.pv-mini .pv-tog, .pv-mini .tkey, .pv-mini .pv-loop, .pv-tcell .tbtns button) {
  border-image: url(img/btn/w2-off.png?v=mwpj9o89) 40 fill / 7px stretch !important; filter: none !important; clip-path: inset(0 round 6px) !important;
  font: 550 10.5px -apple-system, sans-serif !important; color: rgba(236, 238, 241, .82) !important; text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5) !important; }
