/* The Mod's nameplate (tester, 2026-11-13: "a little bit of an embellishment … the icon could be a little bit larger"):
   a recessed plate, as the screens are set into the panel, the icon lit in its own well in the track's colour. */
html body.lay-acc .acc-edcard .ec-n { gap: 12px; padding: 9px 12px 9px 9px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #121110, #181716);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .6), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35), 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .05); }
