/* ==== Mute and Solo, the same keys everywhere (tester, 2026-11-15: "if I mute, I think it should be like a little bit red
   with a line across the M, and then if I solo, it's the way it is right now"): the S and M by the track's screen and on
   its Mods are the track's own (main.ts trackSM). Solo on is gold, as before; Mute on goes down dark, its M red with a red
   slash through it, on the pads' rows too. ==== */
